Dumpware
========
Dumpware is an lightweight CLI helper which automatically
downloads all your needs.


Requirements
============
Dumpware operates in the terminal without any fancy TUI so the
only thing required is GO. Download here: https://go.dev/dl/


How to initiate
===============
go build -o dumpware ./src
./dumpware        # on Unix-like machines
dumpware.exe      # on Windows machines


Might come in handy
===================
* DOCUMENTATION: https://github.com/Orsacle/Dumpware/blob/main/docs
* LICENSE: https://github.com/Orsacle/Dumpware/blob/main/LICENSE
* SECURITY: https://github.com/Orsacle/Dumpware/blob/main/docs/SECURITY


AI Notice
=========
Claude is used to help edit src/catalog/data.go (adding new tools
and install commands). Every package name it adds is manually
checked against the relevant package manager/repo before merging.
Additionally, some files may be generated by AI. Those files have
an disclaimer at the top.


Who even needs this?
====================
Me! and I also made this to get more familiar with Golang as it's
my first time doing something with it.
